#. module: account_move_line_stock_lot
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_move_line_stock_lot/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Lot/serial number %(lot)s does not belong to the lot product of the line."
msgstr "ロット/シリアル番号 %(lot)s は、明細のロットのプロダクトのものではありません。"

#. module: account_move_line_stock_lot
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_line_stock_lot.field_account_move_line__lot_id
msgid ""
"Lot/serial number this line refers to. It is recorded independently from the"
" stock moves, so that it can also be set on lines that are not backed by a "
"delivery."
msgstr "この明細が指すロット/シリアル番号。在庫移動とは別に記録するため、出荷を伴わない明細にも設定できます。"

#. module: account_move_line_stock_lot
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_line_stock_lot.field_account_move_line__lot_product_id
msgid ""
"Storable product this line is about. It is the line's product when that one "
"is storable; on a line of a service, such as a rental fee, it is set by "
"hand."
msgstr ""
"この明細の対象となる在庫管理プロダクト。明細のプロダクトが在庫管理対象であればそのプロダクトです。レンタル料などサービスの明細では手入力します。"

#. module: account_move_line_stock_lot
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_move_line_stock_lot/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid "The lot product of a line of %(product)s is that product."
msgstr "%(product)s の明細では、ロットのプロダクトはそのプロダクト自身です。"
